      <p class="reveal">ARTIFACT turns the museum inside out for one evening only. The galleries stay dark, the lights move slowly, and the collection reveals itself in fragments — a sculpture catching a spotlight, a corridor humming with live sound, a room that exists only for those who know where to knock.</p>
